OL,3,GNEWSABattery trains branded an 'insult'
OL,4,Ato Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician has criticised new battery
OL,7,Fpowered trains as "an insult" claiming
OL,8,Fthey would only reduce travel times
OL,9,Fbetween Hull and Leeds by one minute.
OL,11,FTransPennine Express recently announced
OL,12,Fit was investing #1bn in a new fleet of
OL,13,Fbattery-electric trains for the 2030s.
OL,15,FHowever, former Hull Liberal Democrat
OL,16,Fcouncillor Lord Dave McCobb said he was
OL,17,Fpressing for full electrification of
OL,18,Fthe rail line to Hull saying "our part
OL,19,Fof Yorkshire deserves better".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
