OL,3,GNEWSABattery trains branded an 'insult'
OL,4,Ato Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 29 new trains will enter service in
OL,7,F2034 and have been welcomed by local
OL,8,FMPs and the region's elected mayor Luke
OL,9,FCampbell.
